'''The Cat God''' (神さま, ''Kamisama'', '''God''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy seen as the boss of [[The Big Bang (Cats of the Cosmos)|The Big Bang]] in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 1. He also appears in [[Zero Legends]]. He was added in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]].

