==Enemy==
The final boss of Cats of the Cosmos Chapter 1. He stands at a massive 1,000 range and frequently fires off three lightning strikes that do more than 50,000 damage in total, making him quite difficult to fight.

It's near necessary to max out the [[Mystery Mask]] [[Treasure]] in Ch.1 in order for The Cat God to be at a beatable difficulty level for the average player. Without activating the Mystery Mask, he will have 15,399,989 health and deal 593,967 damage (or 197,989 for each hit).

==Strategy==
The Cat God is quite the threat when guarded by waves of threats and can be a handful. You'll likely have to rely on dealing burst or chip damage with fast units like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] (exploits his Floating trait) and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]] or snipe him through [[Wave Attack|waves]] and [[Surge Attack|surges]] if there are peons in the way.

